      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"kt-testimonials\"><div class=\"page-width\"><div class=\"kt-section-label\">What Customers Say</div><h2 class=\"kt-testimonials__title\">Trusted by <span class=\"kt-gradient-text\">50,000+</span> Tech Enthusiasts</h2><div class=\"kt-testimonials__grid\"><div class=\"kt-tcard\"><div class=\"kt-tcard__stars\">★★★★★</div><p class=\"kt-tcard__quote\">\"The KiTech Pro is genuinely the most impressive piece of tech I've ever owned. The AI learning curve is insane — it literally knows what I need before I do.\"</p><div class=\"kt-tcard__author\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/40?img=11\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>Marcus Chen</strong><span>Tech Director, SF</span></div></div></div><div class=\"kt-tcard\"><div class=\"kt-tcard__stars\">★★★★★</div><p class=\"kt-tcard__quote\">\"I've used Apple, Samsung, Nothing. KiTech blows them all out of the water. The build quality is unreal and the AI features actually work unlike everything else.\"</p><div class=\"kt-tcard__author\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/40?img=5\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>Priya Sharma</strong><span>Product Designer, NYC</span></div></div></div><div class=\"kt-tcard\"><div class=\"kt-tcard__stars\">★★★★★</div><p class=\"kt-tcard__quote\">\"Worth every single penny. The neural processing chip is 3x faster than anything else. Battery lasts 3 days and the AI recommendations are frighteningly accurate.\"</p><div class=\"kt-tcard__author\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/40?img=33\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>Alex Rivera</strong><span>CTO, London</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
